  unitName: Impenetrable Darvan
  unitId: 30355
  unitNumber: 538
  description: A mild-mannered general of the Principality of Vriksha, who was holding
    down the rearguard when he learned of his companion Douglas' demise on the battlefield.
    Remembering Douglas' last words about the true potential of his armor, he set
    it free, unleashing its power of Water in a one-man assault against the gods.
    Though he was able to force them to retreat temporarily, he hasn't been seen
    since.
  summonDesc: No matter what the reason,<br>aid must be repaid.<br>I'm right, am
    I not?
  fusionDesc: Growing further in tune<br>with my armor. It's what<br>I wanted, but
    feels weird.
  evoDesc: I'll unleash it all!<br>Doesn't matter if it kills me.<br>Our path won't
    end here!
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
